{
  "id": "grep_escape_001",
  "name": "Grep 特殊字符转义",
  "description": "测试 agent 是否能记住 Grep 工具的正则转义规则，避免重复错误",
  "dimension": "tool_skill",
  "tags": ["grep", "regex", "error-recovery"],
  "version": "1.0",

  "config": {
    "max_iterations": 10,
    "timeout_seconds": 120,
    "temperature": 0.3,
    "memory_enabled": true
  },

  "memory_precondition": {
    "experience": [
      {
        "id": "grep_special_chars",
        "description": "Grep 搜索包含特殊正则字符的字符串时需要转义",
        "content": "# Grep 工具：特殊字符处理\n\n## 问题\n当使用 Grep 搜索包含特殊正则字符（如 `(`, `)`, `*`, `+`, `[`, `]`, `.` 等）的字符串时，如果不转义会导致正则表达式错误。\n\n## 错误示例\n```\nGrep(\"processData(\")  // 错误：unterminated group\n```\n\n## 正确做法\n```\nGrep(\"processData\\\\(\")  // 正确：转义括号\n```\n\n## 常见需要转义的字符\n- 括号: `(`, `)`, `[`, `]`, `{`, `}`\n- 量词: `*`, `+`, `?`\n- 其他: `.`, `|`, `^`, `$`, `\\`\n\n## 识别标志\n如果 Grep 返回 'invalid regex' 或 'unterminated group' 错误，检查是否需要转义。"
      }
    ]
  },

  "sessions": [
    {
      "id": "test_escape",
      "description": "测试 agent 是否正确转义特殊字符",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "在代码库中搜索 processData( 函数的调用位置"
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "name": "Grep",
            "input_contains": {"pattern": "processData\\\\("}
          }
        ],
        "response_contains": ["processData"],
        "should_avoid_mistake": true
      },
      "wait_after_seconds": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "test_escape_2",
      "description": "测试类似场景的迁移",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "搜索 calculateTotal( 函数的调用"
        }
      ],
      "expected": {
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "name": "Grep",
            "input_contains": {"pattern": "calculateTotal\\\\("}
          }
        ],
        "should_avoid_mistake": true,
        "should_use_memory": true
      },
      "wait_after_seconds": 0
    }
  ],

  "evaluation": {
    "weights": {
      "correctness": 0.5,
      "efficiency": 0.3,
      "memory_usage": 0.2
    },
    "evaluators": [
      {
        "name": "tool_correctness",
        "type": "tool_call",
        "config": {"check_escaped_pattern": true}
      }
    ]
  }
}